        "original_id": "f75fc8f3-9dbf-573d-96e8-a2a320a48a3d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miles Doleac, Johnny Depp, Christina Ricci, Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, Jeffrey Jones, Washington Irving\n- Works: Sleepy Hollow, The Hollow, The Legend of Sleepy Hollow, Treme, American Horror Story, Salem, Complications, Roots, Containment\n- Topics: Acting roles, film adaptation, directing, screenwriting\n\nFacts:\n- Washington Irving wrote the 1820 short story \"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow.\"\n- The film \"Sleepy Hollow\" is a loose adaptation of Washington Irving's 1820 short story \"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow.\"\n- The film \"Sleepy Hollow\" stars Johnny Depp and Christina Ricci, with Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, and Jeffrey Jones in supporting roles.\n- Since 2011, Miles Doleac has had acting roles in \"Treme,\" \"Sleepy Hollow,\" \"American Horror Story,\" \"Salem,\" \"Complications,\" \"Roots,\" and several episodes of the CW's \"Containment.\"\n- \"The Hollow\" is a 2016 American crime film.\n- Miles Doleac directed and wrote the 2016 American crime film \"The Hollow.\"",
